WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.400 --> 00:00:06.057
Waiting until all your lashes have fallen out or your gel has lifted? That's not the best way!

2
00:00:06.057 --> 00:00:09.936
Let's see why lash and nail refills are worth booking on time.

3
00:00:09.936 --> 00:00:14.820
After two to three weeks, some extensions have shed with your natural lashes.

4
00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:19.256
The lash line thins out and gets uneven, and the gaps show.

5
00:00:19.256 --> 00:00:24.319
A refill adds extensions where lashes are missing and replaces the grown-out ones.

6
00:00:24.319 --> 00:00:29.042
It's quicker than a new set, and your lashes always look even and full.

7
00:00:29.042 --> 00:00:33.649
With nails, your natural nail has grown out after three to four weeks.

8
00:00:33.649 --> 00:00:39.752
The gel moves towards the tip, so the nail is top-heavy and breaks or lifts easily.

9
00:00:39.752 --> 00:00:44.052
A refill rebalances the nail shape and covers the new growth.

10
00:00:44.052 --> 00:00:48.532
Your nails stay strong and even, without starting all over again.

11
00:00:48.532 --> 00:00:56.700
In short: when lashes thin out, book a lash refill; when nails grow, book a nail refill, and you'll always look great.

12
00:00:56.700 --> 00:01:02.664
Time for a refill? Book at Moja Beauty, and keep your lashes and nails looking beautiful!

13
00:01:02.664 --> 00:01:08.779
